            <ArticleTitle>Establishment of a human iPSC line (IISHDOi001-A) from a patient with McArdle disease.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>188-192</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">S1873-5061(17)30144-7</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.scr.2017.07.020</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Human iPSC line IISHDOi001-A was generated from fibroblasts of a patient with McArdle disease harbouring the mutation, c.148C&gt;T; p.Arg50Ter, in the PYGM gene. Reprogramming factors Oct3/4, Sox2, Klf4, and c-Myc were delivered using Sendai virus.</AbstractText>
